erlauf Juliet von der Existenz des Clubs „Guernseyer Freunde von Dichtung und Kartoffelschalenauflauf“ erfährt. Die literarische Gesellschaft wurde von einigen Inselbewohnern – ungeübten Lesern – gründet, um sich über die schweren Zeiten während der deutschen Besatzung im 2. Weltkrieg auf den Kanalinseln hinwegzuhelfen. Juliet beschließt über den Club zu schreiben und nach Guernsey zu reisen. Ihr Aufenthalt dort und die Begegnung mit Dawsey wird ihr Leben für immer verändern.","poster":"/91nHBV7jIvHt1xHhGi66vKeZ3J0.jpg","runtime":124.0,"title":"Deine Juliet","type":"movie","va":7.4,"vc":1440,"year":"2018"},"movie:460871":{"cast":[{"id":1954911,"name":"Jesse the Jack Russell Terrier","photo":""},{"id":98157,"name":"Paul Logan","photo":"/ahVtxgcNuQm1js7gmbVR6tQYhTE.jpg"},{"id":74375,"name":"Cynthia Rothrock","photo":"/beYPJbNlN3zHC54Ii6WWS5U4B4R.jpg"},{"id":1954915,"name":"Jayden Hedden","photo":"/gsocEQezCEqX0966GHGppdOd6lL.jpg"},{"id":1954916,"name":"Sian Michelle Guirao","photo":""},{"id":1004839,"name":"Cindy Lucas","photo":"/9LO4coehhZIM01ihqB8J8D9YiRg.jpg"},{"id":160332,"name":"John Callahan","photo":"/qFeZRa5c1mCaV4Ztp3tfY60obZE.jpg"},{"id":1822254,"name":"Errol Sack","photo":"/6s3Rb2Yvh8Rshm61Dkqn9Cxzj5M.jpg"}],"genres":["Familie"],"id":460871,"original":"A Doggone Hollywood","overview":"","poster":"/4AbgA96GJUZIn8tFj3fa6WDiycD.jpg","runtime":84.0,"title":"A Doggone Hollywood","type":"movie","va":4.3,"vc":14,"year":"2017"},"movie:470971":{"cast":[{"id":550159,"name":"Liam Dale","photo":""}],"genres":["Drama","Dokumentarfilm","Kriegsfilm"],"id":470971,"original":"The Rise and Fall of Adolf Hitler","overview":"","poster":"/hh1v0b9rudGOi3uKEIcF6C5XdQj.jpg","runtime":58.0,"title":"The Rise and Fall of Adolf Hitler","type":"movie","va":0.0,"vc":0,"year":"2008"},"movie:507970":{"cast":[{"id":1219597,"name":"Jim O'Heir","photo":"/qrdzPtyh0lWQp8ZxRvWDqBxyi0P.jpg"},{"id":2245864,"name":"Karen Lesiewicz","photo":"/1dSlodHdIjhARmkxkv4dDHAtJSL.jpg"},{"id":2245866,"name":"